sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as API Client
    participant A as MyVanitys API

    Note over C,A: Operation 1 — Add a product to your vanity
    C->>A: POST /products/{productId}/add-to-vanity  + Bearer token
    alt Token missing, invalid, or expired
        A-->>C: 401 ProblemDetail
    else Already in your vanity
        A-->>C: 500 ProblemDetail (generic server error)
    else Product does not exist
        A-->>C: 500 ProblemDetail (generic server error)
    else Added
        A-->>C: 200 ProductResponse (inUserCollection = true)
    end

    Note over C,A: Operation 2 — Remove a product from your vanity
    C->>A: DELETE /products/{productId}  + Bearer token
    alt Token missing, invalid, or expired
        A-->>C: 401 ProblemDetail
    else Not in your vanity
        A-->>C: 400 ProblemDetail (product not found)
    else Removed
        A-->>C: 204 No Content
    end
